# ---- light
commands.arrakis.light.desc = Personal Light: on, off, state
commands.arrakis.light.on.desc = Switch your Personal Light on
commands.arrakis.light.off.desc = Switch your Personal Light off
commands.arrakis.light.state.desc = Show whether your Personal Light is on and its numbers
customUI.arrakisPicker.light = Personal Light

# ---- shield
commands.arrakis.shield.desc = Holtzman Shield: hit, state, shot, cooldown, diag
commands.arrakis.shield.hit.desc = Hits you with projectile damage through the real damage pipeline: arrakis shield hit <damage>
commands.arrakis.shield.state.desc = Shows the toggle, the field, Mana, whether the shield is broken and the cooldown
commands.arrakis.shield.shot.desc = Counts as a shot of yours: the field drops and the cooldown starts
commands.arrakis.shield.cooldown.desc = Shows or sets the cooldown in seconds (not saved): arrakis shield cooldown [seconds]
commands.arrakis.shield.diag.desc = Logs every projectile creation with its creator: arrakis shield diag [on|off]
customUI.arrakisPicker.shield = Holtzman Shield

# ---- weapons
commands.arrakis.weapons.desc = The weapons: give, state, trace
commands.arrakis.weapons.give.desc = Give the ten weapons (the hotbar if there is room, else the inventory)
commands.arrakis.weapons.state.desc = Show the held item, whether it has Ability4 (the H key), and the Holtzman toggle
commands.arrakis.weapons.trace.desc = Log each Ability4 press that reaches the server: arrakis weapons trace [on|off]
commands.arrakis.weapons.diff.desc = Development: lists the fields that differ between two loaded items: arrakis weapons diff <itemA> <itemB>
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Sword_Crude.name = Arrakis Sword (Crude)
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Sword_Crude.description = A sword of house Crude. It looks like the Crude sword and fights like the Crude one: the same swings, the same damage, the same sounds. Right click guards. It does not wear out. H toggles the Holtzman shield.
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Sword_Atreides.name = Arrakis Sword (Atreides)
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Sword_Atreides.description = A sword of house Atreides. It looks like the Thorium sword and fights like the Crude one: the same swings, the same damage, the same sounds. Right click guards. It does not wear out. H toggles the Holtzman shield.
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Sword_Choam.name = Arrakis Sword (Choam)
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Sword_Choam.description = A sword of house Choam. It looks like the Cobalt sword and fights like the Crude one: the same swings, the same damage, the same sounds. Right click guards. It does not wear out. H toggles the Holtzman shield.
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Sword_Harkonnen.name = Arrakis Sword (Harkonnen)
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Sword_Harkonnen.description = A sword of house Harkonnen. It looks like the Adamantite sword and fights like the Crude one: the same swings, the same damage, the same sounds. Right click guards. It does not wear out. H toggles the Holtzman shield.
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Daggers_Crude.name = Arrakis Daggers (Crude)
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Daggers_Crude.description = A pair of daggers of house Crude. They look like the Crude daggers and fight like the Crude ones: the same swings, the same damage, the same sounds. Right click guards. They do not wear out. H toggles the Holtzman shield.
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Daggers_Atreides.name = Arrakis Daggers (Atreides)
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Daggers_Atreides.description = A pair of daggers of house Atreides. They look like the Thorium daggers and fight like the Crude ones: the same swings, the same damage, the same sounds. Right click guards. They do not wear out. H toggles the Holtzman shield.
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Daggers_Choam.name = Arrakis Daggers (Choam)
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Daggers_Choam.description = A pair of daggers of house Choam. They look like the Cobalt daggers and fight like the Crude ones: the same swings, the same damage, the same sounds. Right click guards. They do not wear out. H toggles the Holtzman shield.
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Daggers_Harkonnen.name = Arrakis Daggers (Harkonnen)
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Daggers_Harkonnen.description = A pair of daggers of house Harkonnen. They look like the Adamantite daggers and fight like the Crude ones: the same swings, the same damage, the same sounds. Right click guards. They do not wear out. H toggles the Holtzman shield.
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Maula_Pistol.name = Maula Pistol
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Maula_Pistol.description = A spring-gun pistol that fires darts. Hold it in your main hand: left click fires one dart (click again for the next, about three a second at most); a dart does 1 damage out to 40 blocks. Right click bashes. H toggles the Holtzman shield. Cannot go in the off-hand slot.
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Dartgun.name = Dartgun
items.Arrakis_Weapon_Dartgun.description = A two-handed spring gun that fires darts. Left click fires one dart (click again for the next, about three a second at most); a dart does 1 damage out to 40 blocks. Right click bashes. H toggles the Holtzman shield.

# ---- hud
commands.arrakis.hud.desc = The four-bar HUD: on, off, state, demo, component
commands.arrakis.hud.on.desc = Show the four bars, hide the vanilla Health and Mana bars and switch the Water bars off
commands.arrakis.hud.off.desc = Remove the four bars and give the vanilla bars back (and let the Water bars show)
commands.arrakis.hud.state.desc = Hidden components, the four values, the flash state and the Water link
commands.arrakis.hud.demo.desc = Pins a bar to a percent for a few seconds: arrakis hud demo <power|health|exposure|water> <percent>
commands.arrakis.hud.component.desc = Development: hide, show or reset one vanilla HUD part for you: arrakis hud component hide|show <Name> | reset

